OL,3,GNEWSAPetition started against animal
OL,4,Arehoming plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition has been started against
OL,7,Fplans to rehome birds and guinea pigs
OL,8,Ffrom a Berkshire park.
OL,10,FThe Royal Borough of Windsor &
OL,11,FMaidenhead (RBWM) said it had concerns
OL,12,Fabout the state of Pets Corner on Ray
OL,13,FMill Island, at Boulter's Lock near
OL,14,FMaidenhead, and animal welfare was its
OL,15,F"overriding priority".
OL,17,FThe free, council-owned facility
OL,18,Ffeatures guinea pigs, cockatiels and
OL,19,Fcanaries.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
