OL,4,Arehoming plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetition organiser Samuel Harris said
OL,7,Fthe attraction had been "a familiar
OL,8,Fpart of visits to the island and
OL,9,Friverside for generations of Maidenhead
OL,10,Ffamilies".
